This package helps to maintain gg-framework itself. It is not something that is useful for developers

Maintanence tooling (generation):
* Generates all packages.json files.
* Generates all tsconfig.json files.
* Generates all vitest.config.ts files.
* Fixes dependencies in case file is moved from one package to another.
* Creates DEPENDENCIES.md graphcs for easier dependency checking.
* Finds circular dependencies and gives errors about those.

Build tooling:
* Provides tool helper that updates built dist package with .js files
* Provides tool that moves .mjs files to dist.